OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer hurt after
OL,4,ALiverpool-Man City game
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer was injured, and 10
OL,7,Fpeople arrested, after trouble flared
OL,8,Fwhen Liverpool played Manchester City
OL,9,Fin a fevered atmosphere at Anfield over
OL,10,Fthe weekend.
OL,12,FMerseyside Police said one man was
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion on two offences
OL,14,Fof assault against a police constable
OL,15,Ffollowing Sunday's game in Liverpool,
OL,16,Fwhich City won 3-0.
