OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer hurt after
OL,4,ALiverpool-Man City game
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the officer sustained a
OL,7,Fserious facial injury, with the
OL,8,Fperpetrator arrested on Anfield Road
OL,9,Fafter the game, at around 18:30 BST.
OL,10,FFive fans were also arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of tragedy chanting.
OL,13,FSunday's match was the first game for
OL,14,FCity since the club was found guilty of
OL,15,F114 charges over the breaching of
OL,16,FPremier League financial rules.
